<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Telebras Jan net 279 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Telebras Jan net 279 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state-owned telecommunications firm Telebras issued the following statement on its preliminary results for January.</p>
<p>				Jan 1997	  Jan 1996</p>
<p>    Consolidated net	 279 mln	     N/A</p>
<p>    Holding net		332 mln	     N/A</p>
<p>    Net operating revs    1.174 bln	    N/A</p>
<p>    Gross operating revs  1.537 bln	    N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais. No comparative figures were provided.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
